+// Reason: the fp-walk RBP-safety hook, exported by every variant's
+// collect.cpp. Common's stub returns false; fp-walk forwards to its
+// `rbp_can_read`. Case 14 calls this to drive the helper's accept/reject
+// table without crashing a real thread.
+// Local: test hook.
+bool rbp_can_read_for_test(uintptr_t initial_rbp, uintptr_t rbp, uintptr_t max_stack_bytes);
